element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Untenable_Secret_(Condition)\" title=\"Untenable Secret (Condition)\">Untenable Secret</a> condition from the caster, but possibly pass it on to the targetted ally.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063845\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3801/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63509/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24688/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1394835/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n112.67%   84.183     49 Template:Trim\n100.00%   74.718      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   74.718      1 -total\n 20.82%   15.554     10 Template:Icon_text\n 16.44%   12.283      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 15.80%   11.805      1 Template:Condition\n 14.38%   10.742      6 Template:Icon_link\n 10.60%    7.919      1 Template:Resource\n 10.53%    7.866      2 Template:Cond\n  9.56%    7.143      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:41777-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715063845 and revision id 327905. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}